{
 "section_summary": "This section contains the end of a Japanese overseas broadcasting magazine issue, followed by American diplomatic correspondence forwarding the May and June 1941 issues of Radio Tokyo. The magazines describe programs, transmission frequencies, schedules and intended audiences. Later correspondence concerns listener questionnaires and reception reports sent by the Broadcasting Corporation of Japan to Americans; the section ends with a despatch forwarding the July issue and its cover.",
